      "text": "# Planarity and Graph Structure — The Structural Escape Hatch"
    },
    {
      "id": "09-PLANARITY-AND-STRUCTURE.md#001",
      "path": [
        "09-PLANARITY-AND-STRUCTURE.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
