      "text": "```\n  STRUCTURE DEFEATS HARDNESS\n  =========================="
    },
    {
      "id": "09-PLANARITY-AND-STRUCTURE.md#003",
      "path": [
        "09-PLANARITY-AND-STRUCTURE.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
