      "text": "+---------------------------------------------------------+\n         | ROBERTSON-SEYMOUR (graph minors): every minor-closed    |\n         | family has a FINITE set of forbidden minors. Implies    |\n         | poly-time membership tests for huge classes of problems.|\n         +---------------------------------------------------------+\n```"
    },
